@startuml
title Documentation Build - Detail

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Maintainer
participant GitHub
participant "GitHub Actions" as Actions
participant "Node + MarkBind" as MarkBind
participant "Java + PlantUML" as PlantUML
database "docs/_site" as Site
participant "GitHub Pages" as Pages

Maintainer -> GitHub : push docs change
GitHub -> Actions : trigger workflow
Actions -> MarkBind : npm ci + npm run build
MarkBind -> PlantUML : render each referenced .puml
PlantUML --> MarkBind : non-empty PNG
MarkBind -> Site : write pages and assets
Actions -> Pages : upload site artifact

@enduml
